// Deal or Force - research (ResearchSystem, TechnologyCore.cs). The technologies themselves are in
// common/technologies.
//
// A week of research: ResearchBasePerWeek + ResearchGdpWeight * sqrt(GDP in billions) * human capital
// (Nation.HumanCapital: how developed the economy is, moved by literacy as literacy moves),
// times (education spending / ResearchEducationBaseline) ^ ResearchEducationExponent (held between
// a tenth and four times the baseline), times (1 + research_speed from technologies). The United
// States makes about eight points a week and Mongolia about half of one.
//
// A technology costs its cost times (1 - ResearchDiffusion * the share of the world's GDP whose
// countries already have it).
{
  "ResearchBasePerWeek": 0.5,
  "ResearchGdpWeight": 0.05,
  "ResearchEducationBaseline": 0.045,
  "ResearchEducationExponent": 0.5,
  "ResearchDiffusion": 0.5
}
